Reason: Both queries restrict the outer result set to Chinese patents granted between 2010‑2023, but only 2result.sql makes sure that the inner family test counts DISTINCT application numbers that are actually present (`application_number IS NOT NULL`).  This avoids under‑counting families where some records have a missing application number.  Therefore 2result.sql is the safer and more correct choice.